 # Settings migration fixture
 
-Version 1 stores `theme` at the root. Version 2 stores preferences under a
-`preferences` envelope. Verify with `python3 -m unittest -v`.
+Version 1 stores `theme` at the root. Version 2 stores `theme` and `language`
